  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT MEASURES FOR COMMUNICATIONS &amp; EVENTS- CHILE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this contract is to support and strengthen the communication, public diplomacy and visibility of the EU in Chile and its priority areas: (i) governance and human rights, (ii) green deal/sustainable growth/jobs in connection with ocean and land (iii) digitalisation, science &amp; technology, education, and culture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective(s)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The purposes of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1) &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Foster strategic communications for the EUD initiatives, activities and policy/political priorities in Chile;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Implement public diplomacy actions targeting specific priority audiences;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support visibility around current and new projects funded and co-funded by the EU in Chile;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;4)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Organise events aimed at raising awareness on EU&#xbf;s policies and priorities including celebrations for international days, in particular Europe Day;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;5)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support visibility for Team Europe Initiatives, particularly the TEI for the development of renewable hydrogen in Chile, elaborating communication products together with EUD and EU MS;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
